Package: m6APrediction
Title: Prediction of RNA m6A Modification Sites Using Random Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Zeyu", "Liu",
    email = "Zeyu.Liu24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides random forest-based prediction of RNA
    N6-methyladenosine (m6A) modification sites using sequence
    and biological features. Supports prediction for individual
    samples and multiple samples.
